21:     """
22:     Extract the unique foreground color mask whose cropped shape is symmetric across a vertical axis.
23: 
24:     Input structure:
25:     - The grid has a dominant background and several colored masks.
26:     - Each non-background color forms one candidate mask, possibly split into multiple 4-connected objects.
27:     - Exactly one candidate's bounding-box crop is invariant under left-right reflection.
28: 
